      "title": "The comment records the failure mode, not the code",
      "description": "\"without this sentence that rule suppresses every finding and the review comes back empty\" is exactly the kind of comment that survives — it explains why the sentence cannot be deleted, which is not recoverable from reading the string. The matching rationale on the QA check means the next person hits the same explanation from either direction."
